Structure point:
    Field x as integer.
    Field y as integer.
End structure.
Structure segment:
    Field start as structure point.
    Field finish as structure point.
End structure.
Declare s as structure segment with members start as Compound value of type structure point with members x as 1 followed by y as 2 done followed by finish as Compound value of type structure point with values 3 followed by 4 done done.
Say Member x of Member finish of s plus Member y of Member start of s.
Declare grid as array of structure point with length 2 with elements at 1 as Compound value of type structure point with values 7 followed by 8 done done.
Say Member y of Element at 1 in grid.
